65: ## Test
66: 
67: ```bash
68: npm test
69: ```
70: 
71: `npm test` runs the whole Vitest suite: the colocated unit tests under `src/**` and the
72: cross-module integration tests under `tests/**` (`course-data-validation` checks 10 courses x 9
73: holes; the rest cover physics helpers, the leaderboard and the save manager). Focused subsets:
74: 
75: ```bash
76: npm run test:ui      # UI layer (src/ui)
77: npm run test:input   # input and developer tools (src/input, src/dev)
78: npm run test:camera  # camera system (src/camera)
79: npm run test:watch   # re-run affected tests on change
80: ```
81: 
82: Every suite in the repository runs under Vitest: there is no second runner and no compile step in
83: front of the tests.
